144
00:06:59,199 --> 00:07:00,720
None of us have siblings.

145
00:07:00,720 --> 00:07:01,639
We're curious.

146
00:07:01,839 --> 00:07:02,439
Why isn't Xu Anbo

147
00:07:02,439 --> 00:07:03,839
