148
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:05,600
He has the most say.

149
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:07,279
He went back to take photos for Chi Jia.

150
00:07:08,199 --> 00:07:09,680
He is really a good brother.

151
00:07:10,199 --> 00:07:11,079
Xu Anbo

152
