Typical family style.

168
00:07:40,720 --> 00:07:41,399
Yeah,

169
00:07:42,519 --> 00:07:43,199
seeing

170
00:07:43,199 --> 00:07:44,439
Mr. Lin and Ms. Ye,

171
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:46,279
