175
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:56,959
How do you plan to be mature?

176
00:07:58,439 --> 00:08:00,000
I'll be

177
00:08:00,839 --> 00:08:03,040
as gentle and reliable as you,

178
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:05,920
