181
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:15,120
Like me what?

182
00:08:16,079 --> 00:08:16,879
Forget it.

183
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:20,639
What do you mean?

184
00:08:20,639 --> 00:08:21,800
