224
00:09:53,840 --> 00:09:54,440
Here.

225
00:09:56,240 --> 00:09:57,320
Dinner is ready, Yang.

226
00:09:57,320 --> 00:09:57,919
Come on.

227
00:09:59,120 --> 00:09:59,799
Dig in.

228
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:03,159
Try the soup.

229
00:10:09,399 --> 00:10:09,960
Mom,

230
00:10:11,480 --> 00:10:12,480
