234
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:20,759
I'll put them away later.

235
00:10:21,919 --> 00:10:22,480
Have some soup.

236
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:23,519
Drink it while it's hot, Yangyang.

237
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:31,399
Are you very busy recently?

238
00:10:31,919 --> 00:10:32,840
