252
00:11:00,440 --> 00:11:01,240
Here, Yangyang.

253
00:11:01,879 --> 00:11:02,720
Thank you.

254
00:11:04,840 --> 00:11:06,759
How's work going?

255
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:08,960
Any

256
00:11:08,960 --> 00:11:10,159
