262
00:11:18,799 --> 00:11:19,279
Okay.

263
00:11:21,639 --> 00:11:23,399
Are they all in Yibei?

264
00:11:26,919 --> 00:11:27,480
Yes.

265
00:11:27,960 --> 00:11:29,279
All in Yibei.

266
00:11:30,759 --> 00:11:31,519
By the way,

267
00:11:31,519 --> 00:11:33,720
there's an apartment

268
00:11:34,039 --> 00:11:36,039
