269
00:11:36,279 --> 00:11:37,279
I'm really looking forward to it.

270
00:11:42,960 --> 00:11:43,799
Mom, eat.

271
00:12:08,840 --> 00:12:09,600
Zhou Yang.

272
00:12:12,519 --> 00:12:13,279
Zhou Yang.

273
00:12:14,799 --> 00:12:15,879
What's wrong with him?

274
00:12:18,519 --> 00:12:19,519
Don't go over yet.

275
00:12:20,759 --> 00:12:21,960
Let him be alone for a while.

276
00:12:36,360 --> 00:12:37,519
What happened to him?

277
00:12:40,559 --> 00:12:41,519
What do you think?

278
00:12:42,960 --> 00:12:43,840
His mom...

279
00:13:48,919 --> 00:13:50,320
Practicing on his own.

280
00:13:51,399 --> 00:13:52,720
