282
00:14:11,799 --> 00:14:13,120
Give me the ball.

283
00:14:13,120 --> 00:14:13,440
Give it to me.

284
00:14:13,440 --> 00:14:14,279
Answer my question,

285
00:14:14,639 --> 00:14:15,600
