289
00:14:42,840 --> 00:14:44,200
Then what are you here for?

290
00:14:46,360 --> 00:14:47,559
To annoy you?

291
00:14:53,039 --> 00:14:54,679
I saw how you were just now,

292
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:56,279
