298
00:15:24,480 --> 00:15:25,679
You might as well play a game with me

299
00:15:26,159 --> 00:15:27,399
to vent your emotions.

300
00:15:28,000 --> 00:15:29,200
Maybe you'll feel better.

301
00:15:30,879 --> 00:15:31,960
I don't need it.

302
00:15:32,360 --> 00:15:33,240
Thanks.

303
00:15:34,720 --> 00:15:35,399
If your aunt knew

304
00:15:35,399 --> 00:15:36,639
you were like this,

305
00:15:38,120 --> 00:15:39,879
do you think she would feel better?

306
00:15:59,080 --> 00:16:00,480
Actually,

307
00:16:03,279 --> 00:16:04,840
I can understand

308
00:16:04,840 --> 00:16:06,279
why she didn't tell me.

309
00:16:08,559 --> 00:16:10,120
I just feel a bit sad.

310
00:16:12,639 --> 00:16:14,000
Not for myself,

311
00:16:14,320 --> 00:16:14,519
but

312
00:16:14,519 --> 00:16:15,600
for her.

313
00:16:17,039 --> 00:16:18,600
She works so hard.

314
00:16:23,879 --> 00:16:24,919
So,

315
00:16:25,279 --> 00:16:26,879
you should be happy every day.

316
00:16:27,360 --> 00:16:28,279
Otherwise,

317
00:16:29,080 --> 00:16:30,720
her efforts would be in vain.

318
00:16:41,120 --> 00:16:41,840
Alright,

319
00:16:46,080 --> 00:16:47,039
let's play a game.

320
00:16:58,159 --> 00:16:58,720
Okay.

321
00:17:11,079 --> 00:17:12,279
How's the game today?

322
00:17:13,039 --> 00:17:13,759
Pretty good.

323
00:17:18,079 --> 00:17:19,000
Fu Binyan,

324
00:17:21,200 --> 00:17:22,160
why are you here?

325
00:17:23,680 --> 00:17:24,640
I have something to tell you.

326
00:17:24,960 --> 00:17:25,880
When did you get here?

327
00:17:26,039 --> 00:17:27,359
Did you come as soon as school was over?

328
00:17:28,359 --> 00:17:29,000
Or what?

329
00:17:30,599 --> 00:17:31,799
Then why don't you go in?

330
00:17:32,000 --> 00:17:33,720
I saw you two playing basketball,

331
00:17:33,720 --> 00:17:34,960
so I didn't want to disturb you.

332
00:17:34,960 --> 00:17:36,279
You should have told me.

333
00:17:36,279 --> 00:17:37,079
If I had known you were coming,

334
00:17:37,079 --> 00:17:38,519
I wouldn't have put in so much effort.

335
00:17:39,319 --> 00:17:40,160
Now that the boss is here,

336
00:17:40,160 --> 00:17:41,079
I'll just step aside.

337
00:17:41,079 --> 00:17:41,880
I'm leaving now.

338
00:17:41,880 --> 00:17:42,799
Take your time.

339
00:17:42,799 --> 00:17:43,400
Bye.

340
00:17:44,960 --> 00:17:45,720
Bye.

341
00:17:46,079 --> 00:17:46,920
Let's go.

342
00:17:47,440 --> 00:17:48,319
We're running out of time.

343
00:17:48,960 --> 00:17:49,680
Let's go.

344
00:17:50,480 --> 00:17:51,119
Where are we going?

345
00:17:52,119 --> 00:17:53,200
You'll know in a minute.

346
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:04,759
Why do we suddenly go to Fang He?

347
00:18:05,440 --> 00:18:06,279
My mom

348
00:18:06,279 --> 00:18:07,680
should have gone back by now.

349
00:18:08,599 --> 00:18:10,039
We're not going to find your mom.

350
00:18:10,480 --> 00:18:11,480
Then what?

351
00:18:13,079 --> 00:18:14,279
I just want you

352
00:18:14,920 --> 00:18:16,000
to take this route.

353
00:18:18,039 --> 00:18:19,319
I know what you're worried about.

354
00:18:20,839 --> 00:18:22,119
But this isn't something

355
00:18:22,920 --> 00:18:24,079
that can be solved

356
00:18:24,079 --> 00:18:25,119
with just a few words.

357
00:18:27,079 --> 00:18:28,599
So instead of wasting words,

358
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:30,880
I thought I'd let you experience it for yourself.

359
00:18:32,200 --> 00:18:33,240
Experience what?

360
00:18:34,799 --> 00:18:36,359
The scenery your mom sees

361
00:18:37,319 --> 00:18:38,759
every day as she commutes back and forth.

362
00:18:41,359 --> 00:18:42,519
Seeing this,

363
00:18:43,799 --> 00:18:45,039
I hope it will make you

364
00:18:45,039 --> 00:18:45,960
feel a bit more at ease.

365
00:18:51,559 --> 00:18:52,400
Thank you.

366
00:19:21,359 --> 00:19:22,160
Fu Binyan,

367
00:19:24,559 --> 00:19:26,079
have you ever thought

368
00:19:28,559 --> 00:19:30,519
if your mom hadn't given birth to you,

369
00:19:30,519 --> 00:19:31,400
would she have had

370
00:19:31,400 --> 00:19:32,319
a better life than now?

371
00:19:33,839 --> 00:19:34,599
I never thought about it.

372
00:19:36,920 --> 00:19:37,599
Why?

373
00:19:38,880 --> 00:19:39,759
She gave birth to me,

374
00:19:40,240 --> 00:19:41,359
it was her own decision.

375
00:19:42,200 --> 00:19:44,079
Every choice she made

376
00:19:44,079 --> 00:19:45,400
was well considered.

377
00:19:52,039 --> 00:19:52,759
Why do you ask?

378
00:19:55,759 --> 00:19:57,440
Because I feel

379
00:20:00,359 --> 00:20:01,880
I've been holding her back.

380
00:20:08,559 --> 00:20:09,559
Come on, my boy.

381
00:20:09,559 --> 00:20:10,440
Let's have a toast.

382
00:20:10,880 --> 00:20:11,400
Come on.

383
00:20:17,680 --> 00:20:18,319
Congratulations to mom

384
00:20:18,319 --> 00:20:19,400
for taking on a new project independently.

385
00:20:19,920 --> 00:20:21,200
Is this your first full project

386
00:20:21,200 --> 00:20:22,480
back in the design circle?

387
00:20:23,160 --> 00:20:23,839
That's right.

388
00:20:24,240 --> 00:20:24,920
This is a milestone

389
00:20:24,920 --> 00:20:26,400
for mom's return to the workplace.

390
00:20:26,799 --> 00:20:27,519
From now on,

391
00:20:27,519 --> 00:20:28,680
I'll keep working hard

392
00:20:28,680 --> 00:20:29,839
and try to celebrate more with you,

393
00:20:29,839 --> 00:20:30,480
okay?

394
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:31,799
Okay.

395
00:20:32,640 --> 00:20:33,200
Come on,

396
00:20:33,200 --> 00:20:34,079
let's eat.

397
00:20:34,079 --> 00:20:34,720
It's getting cold.

398
00:20:35,160 --> 00:20:35,839
Hello, ma'am,

399
00:20:35,960 --> 00:20:36,799
this way, please.

400
00:20:47,599 --> 00:20:48,279
Wen.

401
00:20:53,160 --> 00:20:53,759
Yangyang,

402
00:20:54,680 --> 00:20:55,519
long time no see.

403
00:20:56,880 --> 00:20:58,039
Do you remember me?

404
00:20:58,920 --> 00:21:00,319
I used to be an intern

405
00:21:00,319 --> 00:21:01,400
your mom.

406
00:21:02,640 --> 00:21:03,079
I even helped you

407
00:21:03,079 --> 00:21:04,240
with your homework when you were little.

408
00:21:07,599 --> 00:21:08,480
Long time no see.

409
00:21:08,880 --> 00:21:09,400
What a coincidence.

410
00:21:11,319 --> 00:21:11,880
Wen,

411
00:21:12,599 --> 00:21:13,839
I heard you're working

412
00:21:13,839 --> 00:21:14,799
at Geometric Design.

413
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:17,799
Their projects aren't huge,

414
00:21:17,799 --> 00:21:18,720
so the competition is low.

415
00:21:19,359 --> 00:21:20,359
It's a good fit for you.

416
00:21:22,279 --> 00:21:23,359
I'm mainly focusing on

417
00:21:23,359 --> 00:21:24,400
commercial space design.

418
00:21:24,960 --> 00:21:25,720
I've just landed

419
00:21:25,720 --> 00:21:26,559
a few projects recently.

420
00:21:27,359 --> 00:21:28,480
I remember

421
00:21:28,480 --> 00:21:29,559
you also wanted to

422
00:21:29,559 --> 00:21:30,920
develop in this direction.

423
00:21:31,960 --> 00:21:33,240
I'll take you to see it if you're free.

424
00:21:36,680 --> 00:21:37,559
We'll see.

425
00:21:39,039 --> 00:21:39,880
Congratulations!

426
00:21:40,240 --> 00:21:41,160
You're doing great.

427
00:21:42,079 --> 00:21:42,880
Thank you.

428
00:21:43,599 --> 00:21:44,359
If it weren't for you,

429
00:21:44,359 --> 00:21:45,480
retiring bravely back then,

430
00:21:45,480 --> 00:21:46,640
going home to have a baby,

431
00:21:46,640 --> 00:21:48,240
there wouldn't be room for us to rise.

432
00:21:48,960 --> 00:21:50,319
You are my guide.

433
00:21:50,319 --> 00:21:51,400
I always remember that.

434
00:21:52,440 --> 00:21:53,319
Not at all.

435
00:21:54,000 --> 00:21:55,480
This is all your own effort.

436
00:22:02,599 --> 00:22:03,640
Yang,

437
00:22:04,240 --> 00:22:05,119
try this.

438
00:22:05,119 --> 00:22:06,200
It's really good.

439
00:22:06,960 --> 00:22:07,720
Yang.

440
00:22:09,079 --> 00:22:09,680
Dad,

441
00:22:10,039 --> 00:22:10,599
pull over.

442
00:22:10,599 --> 00:22:12,119
What's taking so long?

443
00:22:12,839 --> 00:22:14,640
I've been chatting with Wen for a while.

444
00:22:15,960 --> 00:22:16,920
Long time no see.

445
00:22:19,880 --> 00:22:21,079
It's rare to meet up.

446
00:22:21,480 --> 00:22:22,720
Sit down and eat together.

447
00:22:23,000 --> 00:22:23,839
It's been a long time

448
00:22:23,839 --> 00:22:24,960
since you've seen your son.

449
00:22:25,839 --> 00:22:26,720
Waiter,

450
00:22:27,200 --> 00:22:28,559
two more sets of cutlery.

451
00:22:28,839 --> 00:22:30,000
No need to bother.

452
00:22:30,000 --> 00:22:31,240
I have something to do later.

453
00:22:31,880 --> 00:22:32,880
I won't disturb you.

454
00:22:33,480 --> 00:22:34,039
Yang,

455
00:22:34,680 --> 00:22:36,079
dad will come to see you another day.

456
00:22:41,240 --> 00:22:42,480
We'll be going now.

457
00:22:56,039 --> 00:22:56,680
Mom,

458
00:22:56,920 --> 00:22:57,680
try this.

459
00:23:01,319 --> 00:23:02,240
Thank you, son.

460
00:23:11,119 --> 00:23:11,759
Mom,

461
00:23:12,519 --> 00:23:14,240
I recommend a

462
00:23:14,240 --> 00:23:15,759
particularly delicious milk tea.

463
00:23:16,400 --> 00:23:17,440
You'll definitely like it.

464
00:23:21,440 --> 00:23:22,119
Okay.

465
00:23:22,440 --> 00:23:23,440
I want it with full sugar.

466
00:23:25,000 --> 00:23:26,200
I'll order it for you right now.

467
00:23:27,359 --> 00:23:28,680
If it weren't for me,

468
00:23:29,519 --> 00:23:30,200
my mom

469
00:23:30,200 --> 00:23:30,799
would be

470
00:23:30,799 --> 00:23:32,079
just like that auntie,

471
00:23:32,559 --> 00:23:33,920
doing what she loves

472
00:23:34,799 --> 00:23:35,799
and shining bright,

473
00:23:41,279 --> 00:23:42,640
instead of

474
00:23:42,640 --> 00:23:44,559
spending hours on the bus every day

475
00:23:47,079 --> 00:23:49,279
and still having to cook for me

476
00:23:49,279 --> 00:23:50,200
and take care of me.

477
00:23:52,519 --> 00:23:53,880
You're really overthinking it.

478
00:23:55,880 --> 00:23:57,000
Coming and going,

479
00:23:57,880 --> 00:23:59,279
that's Aunt Xiao's choice.

480
00:23:59,960 --> 00:24:01,559
That phrase about giving up space

481
00:24:01,759 --> 00:24:02,960
is just someone else's definition.

482
00:24:03,079 --> 00:24:04,160
Just listen to it.

483
00:24:04,400 --> 00:24:05,599
Aunt Xiao's decision

484
00:24:06,160 --> 00:24:07,599
is not for others to define.

485
00:24:17,160 --> 00:24:18,599
So do you think she

486
00:24:19,920 --> 00:24:21,279
would regret it?

487
00:24:23,759 --> 00:24:26,079
When you were quietly

488
00:24:26,440 --> 00:24:27,039
watching the scenery

489
00:24:27,039 --> 00:24:28,359
along the way,

490
00:24:29,480 --> 00:24:30,480
how did you feel?

491
00:24:34,440 --> 00:24:35,559
I was thinking

492
00:24:38,039 --> 00:24:39,079
this is the route

493
00:24:39,079 --> 00:24:40,359
my mom takes every day.

494
00:24:42,680 --> 00:24:44,039
It feels very familiar.

495
00:24:45,559 --> 00:24:46,839
Looking at those

496
00:24:47,559 --> 00:24:48,200
streetlights,

497
00:24:49,279 --> 00:24:50,039
tree shadows,

498
00:24:51,079 --> 00:24:51,839
and houses,

499
00:24:56,119 --> 00:24:57,519
it feels warm inside.

500
00:24:58,839 --> 00:24:59,759
That's right.

501
00:25:02,079 --> 00:25:02,839
Aunt Xiao is willing

502
00:25:02,839 --> 00:25:04,480
to spend two hours commuting every day.

503
00:25:05,720 --> 00:25:07,000
She's not regretting it,

504
00:25:08,279 --> 00:25:09,359
but because she knows

505
00:25:10,440 --> 00:25:11,640
Zhou Yang is waiting for her.

506
00:25:13,839 --> 00:25:14,759
Besides,

507
00:25:15,000 --> 00:25:16,400
who says she's not shining anymore?

508
00:25:17,240 --> 00:25:18,240
She secured

509
00:25:18,960 --> 00:25:20,559
Fang He's project all by herself.

510
00:25:22,359 --> 00:25:23,920
Her light has always been there.

511
00:25:25,039 --> 00:25:26,119
What you need to do

512
00:25:29,799 --> 00:25:30,799
is to

513
00:25:30,799 --> 00:25:32,160
shine your light

514
00:25:32,440 --> 00:25:33,400
on her one day.

515
00:25:34,640 --> 00:25:35,440
Got it?

516
00:25:50,640 --> 00:25:51,519
Fu Binyan,

517
00:25:52,319 --> 00:25:54,200
are we almost there?

518
00:25:56,559 --> 00:25:57,680
After getting off,

519
00:25:57,680 --> 00:25:59,039
we'll head back home right away.
